---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@200..1000&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>About | SGA Nexus Intelligence</title>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen p-4 md:p-12 overflow-x-hidden bg-[#020617]">

<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -left-[20%] w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-orange-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full animate-mesh-fast"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-16 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] hover:text-white transition-colors">← Return to Dashboard</a>
        <h1 style="font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;" class="text-5xl tracking-tighter text-white font-black uppercase mt-4">
            THE <span class="text-orange-500">SGA</span> DOSSIER
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Bilateral Tech-Consultancy & Digital Ecosystem</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-16">

        <section>
            <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">01. Organization</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Superior Gaming Agency</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
                <p>
                    <b class="text-white">SGA</b> is an international technology-concierge organization dedicated to high-end digital solutions. We operate as a bridge between specialized hardware needs and advanced software management, ensuring that users—from professional gamers to enterprise-level rigs—maintain peak operational efficiency.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Beyond pure tech, SGA acts as a strategic hub for bilateral innovation, leveraging international partnerships to redefine how users interact with their hardware.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <span class="text-blue-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">02. Infrastructure</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">The Nexus Protocol</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    <b class="text-white">Nexus</b> is the centralized command center of our ecosystem. It is a cloud-integrated dashboard that provides real-time telemetry, session auto-logging, and predictive system monitoring. By unifying hardware data with a streamlined interface, Nexus allows users to witness their rig’s performance with tactical precision.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-24 h-24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">03. The Consulting Phase</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Next-Gen Advisory</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    Our consulting wing is anchored by the <b class="text-white">SGA Agent</b>. While currently serving as a telemetry bridge, the next evolution of the Agent will incorporate <b class="text-orange-500">Autonomous Technical Consulting</b>.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-2">
                    In upcoming phases, the Agent will analyze your system’s unique hardware signature to provide bespoke advice—recommending specific optimizations, detecting bottlenecks before they occur, and consulting on future upgrade paths tailored to your specific usage patterns.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <span class="text-purple-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">04. Hardware Solutions</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">SGA Forge</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    <b class="text-white">The Forge</b> is our premium assembly and retail service. Here, the boundary between consulting and ownership disappears. Users can utilize our expertise to assemble their desired gaming PCs, built with precision and integrated directly into the Nexus ecosystem. From component selection to final assembly, The Forge is where high-performance dreams are engineered and purchased.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-12 mb-24">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">Global Footprint</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Bilateral Foundations</h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        SGA is a testament to international cooperation. Driven by <b class="text-white">two prominent Iranian investors</b>, our project is built on a foundation of cross-border capital and vision.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Our operational core is a lean, agile team composed of talent from <b class="text-orange-500">Iran</b> and <b class="text-blue-500">Hungary</b>. This cultural and technical mix allows us to combine Persian ingenuity with Hungarian engineering traditions, creating a unique perspective in the global tech market.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl flex justify-around items-center h-32">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold">🇮🇷 IR</div>
                        <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1 uppercase">Strategic Investment</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-[1px] h-12 bg-slate-800"></div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold">🇭🇺 HU</div>
                        <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1 uppercase">Tech Operations</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
    @keyframes move-mesh {
        0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
        50% { transform: translate(10%, 5%) scale(1.05); }
        100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
    }
    .animate-mesh-fast { animation: move-mesh 15s infinite alternate ease-in-out; }
</style>
</body>
</html>
---
